Run ./install-vpl-sh as root.

To install without graphical/VNC support, append `-nogui` to an installation
level, for example: `./install-vpl-sh full-nogui`. This is equivalent to
`./install-vpl-sh full nogui`. Graphical and interactive VNC tasks will not be
available in a nogui installation.

To manage development packages separately from the VPL installer,
run `./install-vpl-packages-sh [minimum|basic|standard|full][-nogui]`.
To install Certbot separately, run `./install-vpl-packages-sh certbot`.
